# Raw snapshot IS committed, unlike the steam-retention data/ directory: this is a
# live single-point-in-time pull that cannot be regenerated identically later, so the
# raw response is the reproducibility record, not an intermediate to regenerate.
# (No exclusion rule needed for data/raw/ — nothing below is large enough to warrant one.)

# Processed CSVs are NOT committed — they're fully regenerable from data/raw/ via
# `python scripts/run_analysis.py` and would otherwise silently drift out of sync with it.
data/processed/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Tableau extracts regenerable from data/processed/
*.hyper

# Tableau workspace artifacts, not repo content
*.twbx.bak
*.twbr
~*.twbr
